SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 391 taxa with 3 partitions and 8459 total sites (0.14815% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	389	1510	738	341	909	909	LTRregion_DNA
   2	DNA	391	6009	1716	1040	4208	4208	gag_pro_pol_env
   3	DNA	389	940	280	272	515	515	gag_pX_B_HBZ

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: GTR+F+R3:LTRregion_DNA,GTR+F+I+R3:gag_pro_pol_env,GTR+F+I+R2:gag_pX_B_HBZ

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
   1  GTR+F+R3         -10652.862   21331.725 - 2.72e-312   21331.968 - 5.74e-317   21400.883 -        0
   2  GTR+F+I+R3       -31893.599   63815.198 - 2.72e-312   63815.268 - 5.74e-317   63909.012 -        0
   3  GTR+F+I+R2        -6245.977   12515.954 - 2.72e-312   12516.290 - 5.74e-317   12574.104 -        0

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

SUBSTITUTION PROCESS
--------------------

Edge-linked-proportional partition model with separate substitution models and separate rates across sites

  ID  Model           Speed  Parameters
   1  GTR+F+R3       1.4193  GTR{1.63913,17.2112,1.93397,0.674151,10.1206}+F{0.209788,0.339964,0.238812,0.211436}+R3{0.75583,0.342849,0.223864,2.29617,0.020306,11.1707}
   2  GTR+F+I+R3     0.8581  GTR{1.0867,19.6512,0.907097,1.19817,9.81114}+F{0.247714,0.344265,0.18251,0.225511}+I{0.489902}+R3{0.481282,1.54679,0.0267365,7.15398,0.00207912,30.9186}
   3  GTR+F+I+R2     1.2332  GTR{1.14891,19.5952,1.15766,1.03784,6.10753}+F{0.133481,0.403831,0.172206,0.290482}+I{0.254012}+R2{0.716243,1.15197,0.0297454,5.88025}

